  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your share of luck is of mythic proportions.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Adaptive Fortune<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Increase the number of times you can use the adaptable luck racial trait by 1, and the luck bonus of each type by 2. If you spend one use of your mythic power, you can choose to consider any roll modified by this feat to be an automatic 20, before adding your bonuses.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
